OL,3,ARAF pauses fighter jet training after
OL,4,Atwo pilots eject from plane before
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe force said helicopters from the
OL,8,FCoastguard and the Wales Air Ambulance
OL,9,Fwere sent to the scene close to RAF
OL,10,FValley on the island. The pilots have
OL,11,Fbeen taken to Birmingham for treatment.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the RAF said it was
OL,14,Finvestigating the crash.
